{"conversation":"table-airfield","question":"What is the tower frequency for Kuweires?","reply":{"answer":"The tower frequencies for Kuweires are VHF 120.5, UHF 251.35 low, VHF 39.8, and HF 4.45.","ids":["/encyclopedia/locations/dcs-syria/#af-kuweires"],"topic":["/encyclopedia/locations/dcs-syria/#af-kuweires"],"references":[{"id":"/encyclopedia/locations/dcs-syria/#af-kuweires","title":"Kuweires · DCS: Syria"}]},"ms":1268,"passed":true,"revision":"019e99d4c61b60d5a44c350656fa28e76dbad556"}
